        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Introducing AlphaProof Code: a breakthrough in verifying complex software at depth — Google DeepMind • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • Skip to main content",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T12:02:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:10.915Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Introducing AlphaProof Code: a breakthrough in verifying complex software at depth",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T12:02:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:10.915Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we’re sharing a milestone in software security long considered to be a grand challenge: Google DeepMind researchers guided AI agents to mathematically prove key security properties of the actual code underlying the Signal protocol, the technology that protects billions …",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T12:02:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:10.915Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This breakthrough discovery was made using AlphaProof Code , a novel agentic framework for formal verification at unprecedented depth that combines human expertise with AI agents.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T12:02:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:10.915Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AlphaProof Code is a multi-LLM agentic framework that splits the work of formal verification the way a research team would: human experts work with AI to decide what to prove, and a group of AI agents does it.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T12:02:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:10.915Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Our agents went further, proving that the compiled code fulfills the key security properties – such as keeping messages protected before and after a device is temporarily compromised – down to the exact code running on devices.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T12:02:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:10.915Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To confirm that AlphaProof Code can tell correct code from buggy code, we reintroduced two real, previously fixed bugs into an isolated version of Signal's code.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T12:02:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:10.915Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In AlphaProof Code, AI agents help users write a specification, then autonomously prove that the implementation meets it.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T12:02:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:10.915Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Using AI agents to translate live code into valid Lean theorems is a major breakthrough.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T12:02:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:10.915Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As AI-driven security threats grow, rigorously verifying the Signal protocol implementation gives us even greater confidence in our code's privacy guarantees.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T12:02:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:10.915Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Traditionally, verifying that production code strictly matches its cryptographic design required extensive manual effort, making the use of AI agents to automatically translate live code into valid Lean theorems a great breakthrough.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T12:02:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:10.915Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Verifying Signal's core cryptography lays the groundwork to secure other vital systems, from medical device firmware to power grid software.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T12:02:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:10.915Z"
      }
